test results. ","62":"One important","55":"Rear-side generation","61":"624eac0f-78cb-533b-95ff-98c4c916401a","56":"Up to 10% additional"}},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/fallbackMarkdown","o":"replace","v":"# Best 400W portable solar panels to buy in 2026\n\n(My top pick) **Anker SOLIX PS400 Bifacial**\n\nIf I were buying a 400W portable folding solar panel today, I'd put the **Anker SOLIX PS400 Bifacial** at the top of my list.\n\nThe reason: it combines high output, a relatively lightweight design, bifacial solar cells, and weather protection. It's a particularly attractive choice if you're using it with a portable power station for RVs, camping, or emergency home backup.\n\n## My top 3 recommendations\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn703790product1\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"3:4\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**1\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"turn703790product1\",\"Anker SOLIX PS400 Portable Solar Panel (400W)\"]\ue201**\n\n(Best overall)\n\n# \\$599.99\n\nOff-Grid Source\n\n- 400W bifacial design\n- Approximately 22 lb\n- IP68 protection\n- Particularly good for portability\n  \n  Price from a current retailer listing; verify before purchase.\n  \n  \ue200url\ue202View Anker SOLIX PS400\ue202https://offgridsource.com/products/anker-solix-400w-foldable-solar-panel?utm_campaign=openai_catalog&utm_content=product_card&utm_medium=feed&variant=52395307565352&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn703790product3\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"3:4\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**2\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"turn703790product3\",\"EcoFlow 400W Portable Solar Panel\"]\ue201**\n\n(Best established alternative)\n\n# \\$699.00\n\nEcoFlow\n\n- 400W rated output\n- Up to 23% conversion efficiency\n- IP68 waterproof rating\n- One-piece folding design\n  \n  \ue200url\ue202View EcoFlow 400W\ue202https://us.ecoflow.com/products/400w-portable-solar-panel?utm_campaign=openai_catalog&utm_content=product_card&utm_medium=feed&variant=39998021697609&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn703790product5\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"3:4\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**3\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"turn703790product5\",\"EcoFlow 400W Portable Solar Panel, Foldable and Waterproof F\u2026\"]\ue201**\n\n(Best potential bargain)\n\n# \\$498.02\n\nSam's Club\n\n- 400W folding panel\n- Listed at a substantial discount\n- Worth considering if you already own an EcoFlow power station\n  \n  \ue200url\ue202View at Sam's Club\ue202https://www.samsclub.com/ip/ecoflow-400w-portable-solar-panel-foldable-durable/13615203498?utm_medium=feed&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n## Why I'd choose the Anker\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"Anker SOLIX PS400 bifacial portable solar panel unfolded outdoor\",\"Anker SOLIX PS400 bifacial portable solar panel rear view cells\",\"Anker SOLIX PS400 portable solar panel folded carrying\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"5:4\",\"layout\":\"bento\"}\ue201\n\nThe newer PS400 Bifacial has some impressive specifications\\:\n\n| Specification | Anker PS400 |\n|--------|--------|\n| Rated output | 400W |\n| Weight | 21.9 lb |\n| Cell efficiency | 25%+ |\n| Waterproof rating | IP68 |\n| Warranty | 5 years |\n| Rear-side generation | Up to 10% additional |\n| Official US price | \\$699.99 |\n\nThese are manufacturer specifications, not independent test results. \ue200cite\ue202turn136431search0\ue202turn136431search2\ue201\n\nOne important"},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/requiredComponents/2","o":"replace","v":"Cite"},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/requiredComponents/3","o":"replace","v":"Entity"},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/requiredComponents","o":"append","v":["Link"]},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/appData/opGenui/componentResults/624eac0f-78cb-533b-95ff-98c4c916401a","o":"add","v":{"status":"resolved","state":{"items":[{"url":"https://us.ankersolix.com/prod